SCOPE RESTRICTION (read this before every task):
You may ONLY read and modify files inside the `frontend/` directory.
Never read, open, edit, create, or delete any file under `backend/`, `ml/`,
`datasets/`, `models/`, `notebooks/`, `tests/`, `docs/`, or any root-level
file (README.md, .gitignore, etc.).
If a task seems to require changes outside `frontend/`, stop and explain
why instead of making the change.